   "documentation": "RoboCNC M-code poll: ACTIVE=1 while M<N> pending. The FC1 read is itself the\n   UM<N> ack. EN is the implicit IEC 61131-3 enable pin (STruC++ gates the body\n   on it and never assigns a declared EN member) -- do not re-test EN."
  },
