   "documentation": "RCNC_CONNECT - open / verify the OpenPLC<->robocnc Modbus link (:5008).\n   Like connectCNC() in the GUIs: call this (via the implicit EN gate) from an\n   init step or a dedicated connection program to establish the link explicitly,\n   instead of relying on the first READ/WRITE_PARAM to connect lazily. CONNECTED\n   reports the live link state so the program can gate on it.\n   EN is the implicit IEC 61131-3 enable pin (STruC++ gates the body on it and\n   never assigns a declared EN member) -- do not re-test EN in the body."
  },
