   "documentation": "RCNC_NC_SYNC - consolidated once-per-scan RoboCNC reader for the CONTAHMI port.\n   One instance, called at the TOP of PLC_PRG. Replaces the Eckelmann DPR status\n   window: machine/program state, axis positions + status masks, and the DIN\n   handshake P-parameters the machine logic polls every scan.\n   Register map per RoboCNC docs/reference/plc_contract.md:\n     FC4 input regs : POSIN 0+2*axis (REAL), AXES_STATUS 900+axis,\n                      MACHINE_STATUS 1000, PROG_NO 1002, CURRENT_ROW 1008,\n                      PROGRAM_RUNNING 1010, MOTION_ACTIVE 1012\n     FC3 holding    : P-bank 4300+2*(P-1024) (REAL lo-word-first) for the\n                      DIN handshake spans P1700-1710, P1835-1837, P2029-2047.\n   EN is the implicit IEC 61131-3 enable pin (STruC++ gates the body on it and\n   never assigns a declared EN member) -- do not re-test EN."
  },
  {
   "name": "RCNC_STATE_REQ",
   "code": "#include <robocnc_link.h>\n\nvoid setup() {}\n\nvoid loop() {\n    DONE = (robocnc_write_param_int(2048, (int)REQ) != -1);\n}",
   "variables": [
    {
     "name": "REQ",
     "class": "input",
     "type": {
      "definition": "base-type",
      "value": "INT"
     },
     "location": "",
     "initialValue": null,
     "documentation": "",
     "debug": false
    },
    {
     "name": "DONE",
     "class": "output",
     "type": {
      "definition": "base-type",
      "value": "BOOL"
     },
     "location": "",
     "initialValue": null,
     "documentation": "",
     "debug": false
    }
   ],
   "documentation": "RoboCNC state-machine request (param 2048): 5 build, 7 run, 12 stop.\n   EN is the implicit IEC 61131-3 enable pin (STruC++ gates the body on it and\n   never assigns a declared EN member) -- do not re-test EN."
  },
  {
   "name": "RCNC_STATUS",
   "code": "#include <robocnc_link.h>\n\nvoid setup() {}\n\nvoid loop() {\n    CONNECTED = (robocnc_is_connected() != 0);\n}",
   "variables": [
