   "documentation": "READ_PARAM_DINT - reads a DINT parameter from robocnc (FC4, 2 regs).\n   EN is the implicit IEC 61131-3 enable pin (STruC++ gates the body on it and\n   never assigns a declared EN member) -- do not re-test EN in the body. When\n   the caller passes EN := FALSE the body is skipped and the outputs hold."
