   "documentation": "WRITE_PARAM_INT - writes an INT parameter to robocnc (FC6).\n   EN is the implicit IEC 61131-3 enable pin: STruC++ gates this whole body on\n   the call-site EN (`if (EN) { loop(); }`) and does NOT assign a declared EN\n   member. So the body must NOT re-test EN -- a declared `EN : BOOL` here is\n   always false, which made every RCNC POU a permanent no-op."
  },
